  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Planning Functions in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the Federal and State Ministries of Planning to position the national development plans (NDP-9 and 10) and the State Development Plans to contribute strategically and effectively to the country sustainable development across the humanitarian, development, and peace sectors during its the transition to a stable and peaceful Somalia. The PIP will enhance UNDP&#x2019;s efforts to promote the country&#x2019;s economic development on its path towards stabilization.</narrative>
  </description>
